  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict-sensitive, Climate-resilient and Child-friendly WASH as a Catalyst for Peace for Children in Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced WASH resilience for children to conflict and the shocks of climate change through integrated WASH, Education and Child protection approaches</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this project is to contribute to the related outcomes of the Government of Papua New Guinea Medium Term Development Plan (MTDP) II 2018-2022 in the Key Result Area (KRA) 3 and 7. The project is also in line with the United Nations Development Assistance Framework (UNDAF) 2018-2023, specifically in the Outcomes of People, Planet and Peace.&#xBD84;&#xC7C1; &#xBC0F; &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xBCC0;&#xD654; &#xC601;&#xD5A5;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC544;&#xB3D9; &#xC2DD;&#xC218;&#xC704;&#xC0DD; &#xBCF5;&#xC6D0;&#xB825; &#xC99D;&#xC9C4;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD574; &#xC544;&#xB3D9;&#xBCF4;&#xD638; &#xBC0F; &#xAD50;&#xC721; &#xBD84;&#xC57C;&#xC640;&#xC758; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xC801; &#xC2DD;&#xC218;&#xC704;&#xC0DD; &#xC811;&#xADFC; &#xC774;&#xD589;</narrative>
  </description>
